{"title":"1991 AJHSME Problems/Problem 16","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/5/9a5b4928c8fe50ce3c2428da3bee3505e891b788.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> squares on a piece of paper are numbered as shown in the diagram.  While lying on a table, the paper is folded in half four times in the following sequence:\n</p><p>(1) fold the top half over the bottom half\n</p><p>(2) fold the bottom half over the top half\n</p><p>(3) fold the right half over the left half\n</p><p>(4) fold the left half over the right half.\n</p><p>Which numbered square is on top after step <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/1/ed1c6eeee712c48486ea008b5275ac01deef0319.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] unitsize(18); for(int a=0; a&lt;5; ++a)  {   draw((a,0)--(a,4));  } for(int b=0; b&lt;5; ++b)  {   draw((0,b)--(4,b));  } label(&quot;$1$&quot;,(0.5,3.1),N); label(&quot;$2$&quot;,(1.5,3.1),N); label(&quot;$3$&quot;,(2.5,3.1),N); label(&quot;$4$&quot;,(3.5,3.1),N); label(&quot;$5$&quot;,(0.5,2.1),N); label(&quot;$6$&quot;,(1.5,2.1),N); label(&quot;$7$&quot;,(2.5,2.1),N); label(&quot;$8$&quot;,(3.5,2.1),N); label(&quot;$9$&quot;,(0.5,1.1),N); label(&quot;$10$&quot;,(1.5,1.1),N); label(&quot;$11$&quot;,(2.5,1.1),N); label(&quot;$12$&quot;,(3.5,1.1),N); label(&quot;$13$&quot;,(0.5,0.1),N); label(&quot;$14$&quot;,(1.5,0.1),N); label(&quot;$15$&quot;,(2.5,0.1),N); label(&quot;$16$&quot;,(3.5,0.1),N); [/asy]\" width=\"122\" height=\"122\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/6/6464c5659de4055853e1c6be176fbd768efdde64.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 1 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 9 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 10 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 14 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"357\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Suppose we undo each of the four folds, considering just the top square until we completely unfold the paper.  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> will be marked in the square if the face that shows after all the folds is face up, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> if that face is facing down.\n</p><p>Step 0:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/5/685db5080bb5ae86bc01dfff0d10c0ccc5e209f4.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] unitsize(18); draw((0,0)--(1,0)--(1,1)--(0,1)--cycle); label(&quot;$x$&quot;,(0.5,0.1),N); [/asy]\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" />\nStep 1:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/5/3e5f68ff194760ca2e9407a9b46704654ee02262.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] unitsize(18); draw((0,0)--(2,0)--(2,1)--(0,1)--cycle); draw((1,0)--(1,1)); label(&quot;$y$&quot;,(0.5,0.1),N); [/asy]\" width=\"62\" height=\"32\" />\nStep 2:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/7/e77b8f0100721ce85a69f6ec3057c19909392337.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] unitsize(18); draw((0,0)--(4,0)--(4,1)--(0,1)--cycle);  draw((1,0)--(1,1)); draw((2,0)--(2,1)); draw((3,0)--(3,1)); label(&quot;$y$&quot;,(0.5,0.1),N); [/asy]\" width=\"122\" height=\"32\" />\nStep 3:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/5/035d9d2bf1141cf2e11ecdbf0f004eb678c7edcf.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] unitsize(18); draw((0,0)--(4,0)--(4,2)--(0,2)--cycle); draw((0,1)--(4,1)); draw((1,0)--(1,2)); draw((2,0)--(2,2)); draw((3,0)--(3,2)); label(&quot;$y$&quot;,(0.5,1.1),N); [/asy]\" width=\"122\" height=\"62\" />\nStep 4:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/6/b86859b1f4c429e5e3011c0041f3011ef83366aa.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] unitsize(18); for(int a=0; a&lt;5; ++a)  {   draw((a,0)--(a,4));  } for(int b=0; b&lt;5; ++b)  {   draw((0,b)--(4,b));  } label(&quot;$y$&quot;,(0.5,1.1),N); [/asy]\" width=\"122\" height=\"122\" />\nThe marked square is in the same spot as the number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/e/61ed761ab9327ecd1a537d237eb93c463b8b7b4b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9\\rightarrow \\boxed{\\text{B}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"62\" height=\"24\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME\" title=\"1991 AJHSME\">1991 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1991 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1991 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1991\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1991 AJHSME Problems/Problem 15\">Problem 15</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1991 AJHSME Problems/Problem 17\">Problem 17</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1991 AJHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1991 AJHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1991 AJHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1991 AJHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1991 AJHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1991 AJHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1991 AJHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1991 AJHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1991 AJHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1991 AJHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1991 AJHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1991 AJHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1991 AJHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1991 AJHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1991 AJHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1991 AJHSME Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1991 AJHSME Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1991 AJHSME Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1991 AJHSME Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1991 AJHSME Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1991 AJHSME Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1991 AJHSME Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1991 AJHSME Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1991 AJHSME Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_8_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 8 Problems and Solutions\"> All AJHSME/AMC 8 Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<d